ar over blue-green water beyond open doors, with an ivory headline above and a gold emblem at bottom-right. Text: A skill that's familiar to you can still be worth sharing. Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6ae7f9748fa24.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 02:46:15 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>暮光</title><link>https://some.pics/6ae7e86675c94</link><description>&lt;p&gt;暮光&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Pink and orange clouds drifting across a deep blue sky at sunset." height="4218" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/macmanx/6ae7e86675c94.jpg" width="5624"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://macmanx.some.pics"&gt;@macmanx&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 01:33:30 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>无焰蜡烛法术：助你理解艰难的一课
